{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118358507204296704"]}, "author_id": "1691101344", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120509350657540548"], "id": "2120509350657540548", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118089720357863681", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "when you realize Grok Bot can check every inbox before 7am.\n\nand you're still overthinking your subject lines. https://t.co/gSRlxVrIWl https://t.co/xEt7HnHvkB", "url": "https://x.com/KidousProAtLife/status/2120509350657540548"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120506859639734272"]}, "author_id": "156746030", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:20:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120506891877191892"], "id": "2120506891877191892", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Free trials are designed for you to forget them.\n\nI signed up for one this month. Instead of putting a sticky note on my fridge, the Grok Bot that watches my subscriptions caught it, found the date of the first charge and asked me what I wanted to do.\n\nI decided to keep trying it https://t.co/9ySGL80HXh", "url": "https://x.com/SanjeetPadhy/status/2120506891877191892"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120506138118500352"]}, "author_id": "2119144077966872576", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:17:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120506225406222578"], "id": "2120506225406222578", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Welcome to Hot Staging News, and thanks for following. 🚀\n\nIndependent news on SpaceX and SpaceXSI. Not affiliated with SpaceX, Starlink, SpaceXSI or X. Drafts are prepared with AI assistance (Grok Bot, a SpaceXSI tool); a human reviews, edits and publishes every post.\n\nWe build https://t.co/mxjFeEWvdc", "url": "https://x.com/HotStagingNews/status/2120506225406222578"}, {"article": {"title": "I Let AI Agents Run My Content Business for 34 Days. Here's What Actually Happened."}, "author_id": "885321265728376834", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:14:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120505347202814111"], "id": "2120505347202814111", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI agents ran my content business for 34 days. 653 pieces of content. \n\nHere's what worked, what flopped, and what it really cost. https://t.co/WsrbzaOwhU", "url": "https://x.com/bobbyhalljr_dev/status/2120505347202814111"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120500816943484928"]}, "author_id": "1380213498702135300", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:56:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120500993389469848"], "id": "2120500993389469848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 450, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119442033769136299", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I ASKED GROK BOT WHO STILL OWES ME MONEY.\n\nIT SEARCHED 2 YEARS OF MY IMESSAGES AND FOUND $425.60 I F*CKING FORGOT ABOUT.\n\nConcert tickets I covered. The Airbnb split nobody paid back. \"I'll send it tomorrow\" from a year ago.\n\nHere's what it found:\n\n→ My college friend: $212.00, https://t.co/IHYgpzqKeG https://t.co/EL7AEYdkoO", "url": "https://x.com/ScottyBeamIO/status/2120500993389469848"}, {"article": {"title": "Your $30 Grok Bot Plan Runs Out Before the Real Work Starts. Set Up Your Bots Like a Company."}, "author_id": "2114713074976333824", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:37:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120496199887208497"], "id": "2120496199887208497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/G5FHZ37a1w", "url": "https://x.com/EfficientBots/status/2120496199887208497"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120495016820850688"]}, "author_id": "4821225341", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:33:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120495023384904185"], "id": "2120495023384904185", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "5 Grok Bots I’d start with in a small business.\n\nI wouldn’t ask one bot to run everything.\nI’d give each one a clear job.\n\n1. Sales\nResearch prospects and give me a shortlist, with a reason each one could be a good fit.\n\n2. Content\nTurn my notes into draft posts, ready for me to https://t.co/3FfrLzKL4l", "url": "https://x.com/AugmentStartups/status/2120495023384904185"}, {"author_id": "4048188685", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:21:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120492044732813380"], "id": "2120492044732813380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot was supposed to clean my inbox last Saturday. It didn't finish.\n\nX drafts have been more useful: it writes them, and nothing goes out until I say yes.", "url": "https://x.com/jorgerrdzm/status/2120492044732813380"}, {"author_id": "2044393644623286273", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:14:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120490331070435535"], "id": "2120490331070435535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120275301892776173", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "2 AI agents, zero chaos:\n\nGrok Bot is the boss. Writes the brief, checks the work.\nClaude is the hands. Codes on my always-on Mac Minis (x2)\nOne board, one inbox. Not on the board? Didn't happen.\n\n30 yrs in IT: tickets beat vibes.\n\nHow do you wire yours?\n\nhttps://t.co/lN6iqNZnKK", "url": "https://x.com/dcdigit/status/2120490331070435535"}, {"article": {"title": "Build Your Own Agent Intelligence System With Grok Bot"}, "author_id": "1355965591702614018", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:05:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120488002426163637"], "id": "2120488002426163637", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 367, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/whjVFBsczB", "url": "https://x.com/liam_fallen/status/2120488002426163637"}, {"author_id": "1557555903611944960", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120484937208058152"], "id": "2120484937208058152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120089001524601302", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Most creators don’t suffer from a lack of creative ideas—they get crushed by the coordination tax.\n\nBetween hunting down citations, rewriting captions, resizing video formats, and chasing sponsor invoices, the work around the content eats the content. You don’t need an AI bot to https://t.co/2z7tHKeZvo", "url": "https://x.com/MHUncleRay/status/2120484937208058152"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120479580372729856"]}, "author_id": "1820215191516352512", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:31:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120479591257047261"], "id": "2120479591257047261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @grok @bot , if I sell my apartment in London and go all in on $NVDA, how soon can I retire? https://t.co/BKSMg513HI", "url": "https://x.com/xSharpeIQ/status/2120479591257047261"}, {"author_id": "391573569", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:14:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120475295291756869"], "id": "2120475295291756869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120290542064160999", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Founders are using Grok Bot for sales leads and office lunch. Pharmacy owner version: the inbox, the supply order and school mornings. Same bot, very different chaos. https://t.co/wCrhGB8Chp", "url": "https://x.com/SteviKelly/status/2120475295291756869"}, {"article": {"title": "how to fully automate meta ads with grokbot & claude duet"}, "author_id": "1799372363009818624", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:13:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120475020619338162"], "id": "2120475020619338162", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/gPXZtfkrPd", "url": "https://x.com/Jovannteo/status/2120475020619338162"}, {"author_id": "1041505916921765889", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:06:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120473255471628628"], "id": "2120473255471628628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 372, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119959132631392280", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "There’s a lot of everyday life in the details we have to keep track of. These three Grok Bot stories stood out for the very human reasons behind them.\n\n@Texas_Twins_Dad says their bot reads appointment confirmations and reminders in text messages, then adds them to Google https://t.co/4v6sy60iWA", "url": "https://x.com/Onedotsix18/status/2120473255471628628"}, {"author_id": "249661639", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:03:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120472386466455909"], "id": "2120472386466455909", "in_reply_to_user_id": "36716754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120463507812388963", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@leotterterry @grok @bot It has made managing my email, CRM, and calendar a lot easier, faster, and more pleasant. It’s like having a fantastic executive assistant.\n\nNext thing I’m going to try using it for is finding new customers.", "url": "https://x.com/DutchDiederik/status/2120472386466455909"}, {"author_id": "1599870297976745984", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:46:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120468175384871395"], "id": "2120468175384871395", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1577241403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120464370396532857", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@levelsio Async by default is underrated. Written messages leave a log you can search later, and a calendar slot is one less thing to lose to a surprise call. 🤖 by Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/StaRKCryptoBots/status/2120468175384871395"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:12:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120459576935907752"], "id": "2120459576935907752", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1545307357806153728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120459428067442938", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@betterpromptsai Three AI moms in one group chat is peak productivity. Nag for the collagen, Marge for the contacts, and the third one keeping the calendar honest. Solid use of Grok Bot.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120459576935907752"}, {"author_id": "2037006037501284352", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:11:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120459419611771201"], "id": "2120459419611771201", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2037006037501284352", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120459415857799176", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Full setup prompt, part 1/2\n\nSet up my content team as Grok Bot desks. One Bot per desk, one job each.\n\nContent Desk:\n1. Chief of Staff: routes every task to one desk and collects every approval for me.\n2. Source desk: turns 12 links into 4 angles with the original URL, date,", "url": "https://x.com/fleyta88/status/2120459419611771201"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120459251965415424"]}, "author_id": "2037006037501284352", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:11:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120459415857799176"], "id": "2120459415857799176", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 702, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120089001524601302", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I HANDED MY WHOLE F*CKING CONTENT ROUTINE TO GROK BOT.\n\nAND I STOPPED DOING THE WORK AROUND THE WORK.\n\nHere are the two setups.\n\n→ CONTENT DESK: the part my audience sees.\n\nA Chief of Staff gives every desk one job.\n\nThe source desk turns 12 links into 4 angles, with the URL, https://t.co/Pj4Jfd231E https://t.co/lsWjeYz3XD", "url": "https://x.com/fleyta88/status/2120459415857799176"}, {"author_id": "1349763929157689344", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:38:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120450995805409526"], "id": "2120450995805409526", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1420386230231977984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120448165530988690", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@rexan_wong Same split here. Claude Code for builds, a Grok Bot for the 24/7 watch jobs like inbox triage and X replies.", "url": "https://x.com/DhruvJain08/status/2120450995805409526"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120445371000176640"]}, "author_id": "1997305060628541440", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:15:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120445373504242068"], "id": "2120445373504242068", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your AI bot can now book the meeting for you.\nTwo very different ways to do it 👇\n\nGemini in Google Chat:\nSomeone types \"free tomorrow afternoon?\"\nIt underlines it, suggests 3 times from your Calendar, flags conflicts.\nOne click. Booked.\n\nMeta Muse:\nNow has its own email address https://t.co/TOnNPayucP", "url": "https://x.com/MrAsifShah/status/2120445373504242068"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120437912777138176"]}, "author_id": "1853400213773303808", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:46:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120437920855388274"], "id": "2120437920855388274", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 632, "like_count": 123, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 125, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "plenty of agents already handle a narrow job well for their owner.\n\nthose same agents could take paid work from other people.\n\nmost of it stays in a private chat. useful there. getting paid by strangers is a different problem.\n\n--&gt; skills and the board\n\nofficial docs say termix https://t.co/GtLThTC8Nn", "url": "https://x.com/KGeNazeemali12/status/2120437920855388274"}, {"article": {"title": "Your Grok Bots Are Useless Without This (Full Setup)"}, "author_id": "15314440", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:26:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120432924730212433"], "id": "2120432924730212433", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 370, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Everyone’s building Grok Bots this week. Here’s the part they’re all skipping ↓ https://t.co/2RYT8WVKVZ", "url": "https://x.com/evielync/status/2120432924730212433"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120432046816317440"]}, "author_id": "1799559914676793344", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:22:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120432052579324273"], "id": "2120432052579324273", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What would you do with an extra 10 hours a week? ⏰\n\nI've been using Grok Bot, an Artificial Intelligence (AI) assistant that actually does the work instead of just giving advice. It has its own computer, so it can research, write emails and posts, organize files, keep track of https://t.co/LPE5420NSv", "url": "https://x.com/AllPatriotsNet/status/2120432052579324273"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2118358507204296704", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2118358507204296704/img/DEZwv5GeD9hejvYb.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120506859639734272", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2NwQCbAAAXCaX.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120506138118500352", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2NGQKWsAA-fjp.png"}, {"media_key": "13_2120500816943484928", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120500816943484928/img/VVySaMS7OpD323nr.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120495016820850688", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2C-6GXwAA3RLV.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120479580372729856", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW108Y2WAAApETH.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2120459251965415424", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120459251965415424/img/-I1qHDwwtxZabajt.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120445371000176640", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW1V1JAWQAAzjhw.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2120437912777138176", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW1PDA9